# Test fixtures are compared byte for byte, so their line endings are part of the
# fixture. Without this, a Windows checkout with `core.autocrlf=true` — which is
# what the GitHub Windows runner and a default Git for Windows install both do —
# rewrites every LF to CRLF, and a test that asserts a rendered template equals a
# string written with `\n` fails on Windows and nowhere else. The frontmatter
# parser these fixtures feed returns a body verbatim on purpose (see the
# `crlf_line_endings_parse` unit test in src/skills.rs), so the fix belongs at the
# checkout boundary rather than in the parser.
tests/fixtures/** text eol=lf

# Binary fixtures, which the rule above would otherwise treat as text: any byte
# pair `0D 0A` inside one gets rewritten to `0A` on `git add`, silently
# corrupting the committed file. This is not hypothetical — both 0.29.0
# cross-version databases tripped it on their first write, and the 0.22.0 ones
# survived only because no page of theirs happened to contain that pair.
#
# Listed by extension rather than as a blanket `-text` on the directory: the rule
# above exists because the template fixtures ARE compared byte for byte as text
# and must be LF on a Windows checkout, so turning the whole tree binary would
# trade one silent corruption for another.
#
# Every extension a fixture could plausibly arrive as is here, not only the one
# that bit. The failure mode is the reason: a corrupted `.docx` or `.png` fixture
# does not report itself as a git problem, it reports itself as a broken parser,
# and somebody spends an afternoon in the wrong file. The documents and media
# tests generate their fixtures at run time today, which is why this has not bitten
# there yet — the first committed one is when it would have.
tests/fixtures/**/*.sqlite3 binary
tests/fixtures/**/*.db binary
tests/fixtures/**/*.png binary
tests/fixtures/**/*.jpg binary
tests/fixtures/**/*.jpeg binary
tests/fixtures/**/*.pdf binary
tests/fixtures/**/*.zip binary
tests/fixtures/**/*.docx binary
tests/fixtures/**/*.xlsx binary
tests/fixtures/**/*.pptx binary
